Alembic migrations for the BuildSEO backend.

Conventions
-----------
* One concern per revision, numbered 0001..NNNN in dependency order.
* Every revision implements a working ``downgrade``.
* Row-Level Security lives in a single revision (0017) so the whole policy set
  is reviewable in one place.
* Privilege grants (0018) target the role named by ``DB_APP_ROLE`` and are
  skipped when that role does not exist, so the same revision runs in CI,
  development and production.
* Never apply DDL to a deployed database by hand.

Usage
-----
    alembic upgrade head          # apply
    alembic downgrade -1          # revert one revision
    alembic history --verbose     # inspect
    alembic upgrade head --sql    # render SQL without executing
